      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the suggestions! i've heard of those before. i was wondering though, since st. john's wort is natural, does it actually interfere with the pill at all? like, i don't want to have to start using condoms or anything because that's such a hassle, but i feel like if i just take the dosage you suggested, it should be fine, right?",
